{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_170_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_170","textTraditional":"一、二十有一年，春王正月，公如晉。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_170_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_170","textTraditional":"二、邾婁庶其以漆閭丘來奔。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_170_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_170","textTraditional":"邾婁庶其者何？邾婁大夫也。邾婁無大夫，此何以書？重地也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_170_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_170","textTraditional":"三、夏，公至自晉。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_170_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_170","textTraditional":"四、秋，晉欒盈出奔楚。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_170_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_170","textTraditional":"五、九月庚戌朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_170_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_170","textTraditional":"六、冬十月庚辰朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_170_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_170","textTraditional":"七、曹伯來朝。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_170_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_170","textTraditional":"八、公會晉侯、齊侯、宋公、衞侯、鄭伯、曹伯、莒子、邾婁子于商任。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_170_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_170","textTraditional":"九、十有一月庚子，孔子生。","sentenceOrder":10}],"overrides":{}}